'''Magnus''' Rasmodius is the local wizard of Stardew Valley. He works alongside [[Marlon]] to protect the valley from corrupt monsters. He is one of the bachelors available in SVE.

For canon information on the Wizard, please refer to the [[Stardew:Wizard|Stardew Valley Wiki - Wizard]] page.

